---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: nationalities
  size: 1
  alias: nat
permalink: "/visas/best-nomad-visas-for-{{ nat.slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  pageTitle: "Best Digital Nomad Visas for {{ nat.name }} in 2026"
  pageDescription: "How {{ nat.name }} can navigate {{ nat.taxQuirk }} and use the {{ nat.taxSolution }} to minimize their global tax burden as a digital nomad."
---

{% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}

<div class="section-container mt-16">
    <div class="comparison-hero text-center mb-16">
        <div class="badge-2026 mb-4">
            <span style="display:inline-block; width:8px; height:8px; background:#10b981; border-radius:50%; margin-right:5px;"></span>
            2026 Strategy Guide
        </div>
        <h1 class="aura-title">The Best Digital Nomad Visas<br>for {{ nat.name }}</h1>
        <p class="text-dim mb-8" style="font-size: 1.15rem; max-width: 700px; margin: 1rem auto 0;">
            {{ nat.description }}
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="expert-analysis">
        <h2 class="mb-6">The {{ nat.name }} Tax Dilemma: {{ nat.taxQuirk | capitalize }}</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">
            When you hold a passport from the {{ nat.countryCode }}, international relocation requires structural financial planning. 
            The biggest hurdle is navigating <strong>{{ nat.taxQuirk }}</strong>. Simply boarding a flight and working from Bali does not sever your obligations back home. 
            However, by properly applying the <strong>{{ nat.taxSolution }}</strong>, you can radically reduce your effective tax rate.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mb-4 mt-8">Top Visa Recommendations for {{ nat.name }}</h3>
        <ul style="list-style-type: none; padding: 0;">
            {% for topVisa in nat.topVisas %}
                <li style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
                    <h4 style="color: var(--aura-primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1.25rem;">{{ topVisa }} Digital Nomad Visa</h4>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">A popular choice for {{ nat.countryCode }} passport holders offering a streamlined path to residency.</p>
                    <a href="/visas/{{ topVisa | slugify }}/" class="premium-btn w-full text-center" style="display: block;">View {{ topVisa }} Tax ROI</a>
                </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>

        <div class="glass-panel mt-12 p-8 text-center" style="background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1); border-color: var(--aura-primary);">
            <h3 class="mb-4">Calculate Your Personal Tax Savings</h3>
            <p class="mb-6">Use Nomad Budgeter to see exactly how much you can save in 2026.</p>
            <a href="/?nationality={{ nat.countryCode }}" class="action-btn" style="padding: 1rem 2rem; display: inline-block;">Open Calculator →</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

